## Model card

- **Name:** Mercury 2
- **Short description:** Inception Labs' diffusion LLM (dLLM) focused on very high token throughput and low-latency reasoning/chat for production loops such as coding assistance, agentic steps, voice, and search/RAG pipelines.
- **Provider / access:** Inception API and partner platforms (OpenAI-compatible chat completions); model id `mercury-2`.
- **Release / knowledge:** Announced February 2026 by Inception Labs ("Introducing Mercury 2"); knowledge cutoff not stated in verified public sources reviewed.
- **IDs:** `inception/mercury-2` (no Free ID on Zen; `noFreeId` per local meta).
- **Context window:** 128K total / 50K output (per Inception docs/local meta).
- **Modalities:** Text and vision in; text out (per local meta). Tool use and structured outputs supported per Inception docs.
- **Pricing (as of 2026-11-11):** $0.25 / $0.75 per 1M input/output tokens, $0.025 cached input (Inception docs).
- **Architecture:** Proprietary diffusion-based language model; parameter count not publicly disclosed.

